# OVOS-INTENT-2 §6.1: phrases that suppress Spell.intent from matching at all.
#
# "spell check my essay", "run a spell checker" and friends share the word
# "spell" with every training sample but ask for proofreading, not for a word
# to be read out letter by letter. Without this the "spell {word}" sample
# claims them and the skill spells the rest of the sentence.
spell check
spellcheck
spell checker
spell checking
